  "description": "Drop-in replacement shim for Ninject, the deprecated .NET DI container.\n      Replace your Ninject NuGet reference with Rokstep.Ninject.Shims and your\n      existing code continues to work on .NET 6/8 without changes. Powered internally\n      by Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection. Every public type is marked\n      [Obsolete] with DiagnosticId \"RKSNI####\" pointing to migration guidance —\n      this is a transitional package to be removed after full migration to modern\n      .NET DI patterns.",
